WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.122 --> 00:00:02.690
- Let's say you were
dropped in the wilderness

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:06.280
and you can only pick
one of us to be with you,

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.104
to help you get through the wilderness.

00:00:08.104 --> 00:00:08.937
- Oh, that's obvious.

00:00:08.937 --> 00:00:10.450
- I mean, I think they're gonna
be boring, and they're gonna

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.283
pick each other.
- You're asking me this?

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:13.630
- [Kelly] But, like what
are you, who would you pick?

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.330
- I'd pick Blake and I would
kill him and take the vodka

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.163
in his back pocket.

00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:19.610
(laughing)
(clapping)

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.444
'Cause I got news for ya,

00:00:21.444 --> 00:00:23.900
you see his Starbucks
mug on "The Voice" right?

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.270
You all see that, it ain't coffee!

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:26.370
- [Kelly] It ain't coffee.
(audience laughing)

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.760
- I got news for you, so yeah.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.229
- I don't know how y'all do
this job without drinking.

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:31.260
(laughing)

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.460
- I don't know how you do it drinking,

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.033
- I know.
- I would, whoa, it would be--

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.411
- I partake a little bit just enough.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.410
(laughing)

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:38.990
- Yeah, little red wine for John.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:39.920
- [John] Just enough.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.670
- Oh I can't, I wouldn't,
I'm already crazy.

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:43.630
So, yeah.

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.690
Wait, who would you pick
on an island like if,

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.560
or wilderness, if you got
dropped in the wilderness,

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:48.530
and you just had to pick

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.037
one of us.
- Oh no,

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.726
I feel like Blake because he--

00:00:53.726 --> 00:00:54.559
- [Kelly] What the hell!

00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:55.396
- He's got all these--

00:00:55.396 --> 00:00:56.627
(audience laughing)

00:00:56.627 --> 00:00:57.460
- I am not useless!

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.340
- He's got all these acres of

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.963
ranch land in Oklahoma and--
- I have like seven thousand

00:01:00.963 --> 00:01:02.161
acres of land as well!

00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:04.070
- I feel like like he would know

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:05.400
a lot of "out-doorsy" things

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.840
that would get us through life over there.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:07.794
- He'd also make a good raft!

00:01:07.794 --> 00:01:10.510
(laughing)

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:12.570
- Kelly, you can't even
beat me on your own show.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.410
- I can't even beat you on my own show!

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:15.250
- But, it's true!

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.070
I remember the first
time I went to Oklahoma

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.930
with my family, we are like from Anaheim

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.217
we'd never seen even trees
before so we were like,

00:01:21.217 --> 00:01:22.770
"Wow! This is like crazy!"

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.320
And were like driving,
and Blake's in his truck,

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.570
and there's a tree that
had, like, been blown down

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:29.917
on the road and Blake
gets out and he's like,

00:01:29.917 --> 00:01:31.530
"All right" and he gets
in the back of the truck

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:32.363
he has like-
- A chainsaw!

00:01:32.363 --> 00:01:34.390
- A big chain, and he pulls it out,

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:36.770
he wraps it around the tree and like,

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.520
my whole family's like, "Oh my God!

00:01:40.358 --> 00:01:42.677
"He's a man!" it was like--

00:01:42.677 --> 00:01:47.253
(clapping)
(cheering)

00:01:47.253 --> 00:01:49.552
- [Carson] Gwen, knew she was in love!

00:01:49.552 --> 00:01:51.158
- So good answer.
- We do that,

00:01:51.158 --> 00:01:53.930
my husband is kind of different
he pulls out a chainsaw!

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:55.863
He just saws it and moves it.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:00.090
- Blake was so, early on in
the show, he'd be in L.A.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:02.280
And he's such an Oklahoman
I mean, he really is.

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:05.980
He was miserable here before
he started fornicating with--

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.075
- Oh, my what?

00:02:07.075 --> 00:02:09.410
(clapping)
(cheering)

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:10.502
- Here, here! (claps)

00:02:10.502 --> 00:02:11.537
(clapping)
(cheering)

00:02:11.537 --> 00:02:13.304
- [Carson] Thank God!

00:02:13.304 --> 00:02:14.425
Thank you Gwen!

00:02:14.425 --> 00:02:15.258
- So stupid!

00:02:15.258 --> 00:02:16.091
- Thank you to Gwen!

00:02:16.091 --> 00:02:18.320
But before Gwen-
- Blake does make her,

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.120
Gwen does make him happier (laughs).

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.890
- When we were in L.A.
it would be a mission

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.950
to try and find something
for the cowboy to do

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.940
'cause he was such a
fish out of water in L.A.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:29.010
And so we had the idea, one day we went to

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.530
where he would, I thought, be comfortable.

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:33.216
and I took him to an
old, to a Bass Pro Shop.

00:02:33.216 --> 00:02:34.049
(laughing)

00:02:34.049 --> 00:02:36.045
You know that, and I--

00:02:36.045 --> 00:02:37.130
- Favorite shop in the world.
- That Pro Shop is great!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.937
- Walking around with Blake
Shelton as a Bass Pro Shop

00:02:38.937 --> 00:02:41.518
was like walking around with
Jesus Christ at the Vatican

00:02:41.518 --> 00:02:43.140
(clapping)
(laughing)

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.042
like his people are there!

00:02:45.042 --> 00:02:47.373
He was very at home,
- We found each other.

00:02:47.373 --> 00:02:49.023
he's like "I'm comfortable here!"

